<rml>
<head>
	<!-- The maintenance countdown (uimaintenance.py MaintenanceWindow, NOVA-58;
	     P18): the time left until a scheduled server shutdown, at the top
	     left (legacy's (10, 70)). game.py opens it with the seconds the server
	     sends (shutdown_schedule) and closes it on a cancel
	     (shutdown_cancel). While the maintenance flag is on (the hud group),
	     game.py makes nui_maintenance.MaintenanceWindow (controller
	     assets/root/nui_maintenance.py), a facade with the legacy class's
	     name and methods. The time is a nui-countdown: legacy's format
	     (RTSecondToDHMS), its count (round="up": the time left to the
	     millisecond, rounded up, so 125 seconds show until a whole second has
	     passed and 1 in the last one), its width that never narrows while
	     open (hold-width), and countdownend, which hides the board at the
	     end; no Python runs while it counts. The document exists only while
	     the countdown shows (nui_hud.OnDemand). It draws above the legacy UI
	     layer, so no HUD window at the top left (the affects) covers it, and
	     each open brings it above the other NovaUI windows (legacy's
	     SetTop). The body takes no pointer; the board takes a press (it
	     raises the board) and its close button closes it. -->
	<title>maintenance</title>
	<link type="text/template" href="../../nui.rtpl"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="maintenance.rcss"/>
</head>
<body template="nui" class="nui-overlay maintenance" data-model="maintenance">
	<div id="maintenance" class="nui-board nui-fx nui-interactive maintenance__board"
	     data-event-mousedown="board_press(ev.button)">
		<span id="maintenance-label" class="maintenance__label">@game.MAINTENANCE_TIME_LEFT</span>
		<nui-countdown id="maintenance-time" class="maintenance__time" format="dhms" round="up" hold-width="on"
		               day="@game.DAY" hour="@game.HOUR" minute="@game.MINUTE" second="@game.SECOND"
		               data-attr-end="end" data-event-countdownend="ended()"/>
		<button id="maintenance-close" class="nui-button nui-button--ghost nui-button--icon-sm nui-anim nui-has-tooltip maintenance__close"
		        data-event-mousedown="close_press(ev.button)"><span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--close"><span
			class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span><span
			class="nui-tooltip nui-anim maintenance__tip">@game.UI_CLOSE</span></button>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
